# Training runs and model weights stay local. Of the data, only the hand-written starter
# set is tracked here. Seeds are excerpts of real sessions and built pairs are derived:
# both stay out, as do synthetic batches and evaluation files until they are released.
/runs/
/data/*
!/data/starter/
models/
checkpoints/
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.bin
*.npy
*.npz
